  <entry>
    <title>Python多进程、多线程、多管程浅解</title>
    <link href="http://example.com/pyAio/"/>
    <id>http://example.com/pyAio/</id>
    <published>2025-07-13T04:00:47.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-07-20T09:18:57.811Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="多进程"><a href="#多进程" class="headerlink" title="多进程"></a>多进程</h2><p>Python多进程是一种通过操作系统级资源分配实现并发执行的技术，其核心在于利用多个独立的进程并行处理任务。</p><h3 id="功能说明"><a href="#功能说明" class="headerlink" title="功能说明"></a>功能说明</h3><ul><li><p>并行计算</p><p>Python多进程通过 multiprocessing 模块实现真正的并行执行，每个进程拥有独立的内存空间和执行环境，可同时利用多核CPU。</p></li><li><p>资源分配与隔离</p><p>进程是操作系统分配资源的基本单位，每个进程独立运行，互不干扰。进程的动态性体现在其生命周期中，从创建到终止均由系统管理。多进程的隔离性使其在稳定性上优于多线程，尤其适合CPU密集型任务。</p></li><li><p>通信与同步机制</p><ul><li>进程间通信（IPC） ：通过Queue（队列）、Pipe（管道）、Manager（共享内存）等工具实现数据传递。Queue适用于主进程与子进程之间的数据交换，而Manager支持复杂数据结构的共享。</li><li>同步原语：使用Lock、Barrier等同步对象协调多个进程的执行顺序，避免竞争条件。</li></ul></li><li><p>进程池管理</p><p>multiprocessing.Pool 简化了批量任务的并行处理。通过 pool.map() 可以将任务分配给进程池，自动管理进程生命周期。</p></li></ul><h3 id="实现方法"><a href="#实现方法" class="headerlink" title="实现方法"></a>实现方法</h3><ul><li><p>直接创建进程</p><ul><li><p>Process类</p><p>通过multiprocessing.Process创建进程对象，指定target函数和args参数。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> multiprocessing</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> os</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">worker1</span>():</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># printing process id</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;ID of process running worker1: &#123;&#125;&quot;</span>.<span class="built_in">format</span>(os.getpid()))</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">worker2</span>():</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># printing process id</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;ID of process running worker2: &#123;&#125;&quot;</span>.<span class="built_in">format</span>(os.getpid()))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="string">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># printing main program process id</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;ID of main process: &#123;&#125;&quot;</span>.<span class="built_in">format</span>(os.getpid()))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># creating processes</span></span><br><span class="line">    p1 = multiprocessing.Process(target=worker1)</span><br><span class="line">    p2 = multiprocessing.Process(target=worker2)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;haven\&#x27;t started yet&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># starting processes</span></span><br><span class="line">    p1.start()</span><br><span class="line">    p2.start()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># process IDs</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;ID of process p1: &#123;&#125;&quot;</span>.<span class="built_in">format</span>(p1.pid))</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;ID of process p2: &#123;&#125;&quot;</span>.<span class="built_in">format</span>(p2.pid))</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;started&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># wait until processes are finished</span></span><br><span class="line">    p1.join()</span><br><span class="line">    p2.join()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># both processes finished</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Both processes finished execution!&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># check if processes are alive</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Process p1 is alive: &#123;&#125;&quot;</span>.<span class="built_in">format</span>(p1.is_alive()))</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Process p2 is alive: &#123;&#125;&quot;</span>.<span class="built_in">format</span>(p2.is_alive()))</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;&#x27;  输出结果  </span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    ID of main process: 29952</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    haven&#x27;t started yet</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    ID of process p1: 9956</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    ID of process p2: 11804</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    started</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    ID of process running worker1: 9956</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    ID of process running worker2: 11804</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    Both processes finished execution!</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    Process p1 is alive: False</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    Process p2 is alive: False</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    &#x27;&#x27;&#x27;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>可以看到p1.start()之后并不直接执行，而是继续执行主进程，直到p1.join()，将主进程阻塞至p1执行完毕</p></li><li><p>守护进程</p><p>通过 daemon&#x3D;True 设置进程为守护进程，主进程退出时自动终止子进程</p><p>借助 Process类 中的代码可以看到不设置 daemon 主程序只管自己结束，然后子程序还在运行</p><p>设置了 daemon 主程序结束了 就全结束了  所以要设置 daemon+join 阻塞主程序，等待子程序运行结束后在运行主程序</p><p>即daemon一般与join配套使用</p></li></ul></li><li><p>继承Process类</p><p>自定义进程类继承multiprocessing.Process，重写run()方法。例如</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> multiprocessing <span class="keyword">import</span> Process</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">MyProcess</span>(<span class="title class_ inherited__">Process</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">__init__</span>(<span class="params">self, name</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">super</span>().__init__()</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="variable language_">self</span>.name = name</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">run</span>(<span class="params">self</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&#x27;测试<span class="subst">&#123;self.name&#125;</span>多进程&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="string">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    p = MyProcess(<span class="string">&#x27;bob&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    p.start()</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#输出结果：</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#测试bob多进程</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>记住一定是 run 方法才会被视作 target 方法执行。</p></li></ul><h3 id="注意事项"><a href="#注意事项" class="headerlink" title="注意事项"></a>注意事项</h3><ul><li><p>性能开销</p><ul><li>进程启动成本：每次创建进程需复制内存和资源，开销远高于线程。一般根据服务器配置调整进程数量，避免过度消耗。</li><li>通信开销：进程间通信（如Queue）需额外开销，需权衡效率与复杂度</li></ul></li><li><p>守护进程设置</p><ul><li>Windows系统要求进程代码位于if <strong>name</strong> &#x3D;&#x3D; ‘<strong>main</strong>‘块内，否则可能导致死循环（当然，好的IDE你不写在if <strong>name</strong> &#x3D;&#x3D; ‘<strong>main</strong>‘块内，会自动报错）</li><li>守护进程的 daemon 属性需谨慎设置，避免主进程退出时子进程残留</li></ul></li><li><p>同步与竞争条件</p><ul><li>共享内存风险：直接共享变量（如全局变量）可能导致数据不一致，需使用Lock或RLock同步。另外子进程与父进程不共享内存空间，即子进程获得父进程环境变量的独立副本，子进程对环境的修改不影响父进程，反之亦然</li><li>死锁问题：多进程间的同步逻辑需避免死锁，例如使用Barrier协调多个进程的等待状态</li></ul></li></ul><hr><h2 id="多线程"><a href="#多线程" class="headerlink" title="多线程"></a>多线程</h2><hr><h2 id="多管程"><a href="#多管程" class="headerlink" title="多管程"></a>多管程</h2><hr><h2 id="对比分析"><a href="#对比分析" class="headerlink" title="对比分析"></a>对比分析</h2>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">本文简单介绍了Python多进程、多线程、多管程的实现方法、函数使用以及注意事项，默认读者已经了解什么是进程和线程，了解进程和线程的区别</summary>
    
    
    
